@startuml
title Activity (Part 1 - Submit) - Purchase Request Submission Flow

|Requester|
start
:Open Purchasing > Creation;
:Fill request form\n(item, quantity, unit, justification);
:Click Submit;

|System|
if (Required fields complete?) then (Yes)
  :System assigns localId;
  :Save record to purchase-requests store;
  :Detect request status = submitted;
  :Send notification to Requester\n(in-app + Gmail);
  :Send notification to Executive\n(in-app + Gmail, new approval request);
  :Request appears in Review list;
  :Request is ready for reviewer action;
  stop
else (No)
  |Requester|
  :Show validation message\n(missing required fields);
  stop
endif

@enduml
